{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>בקרבה</b> — the meaning is doubled." "<b>מרחובה</b> — it is the broad line, which surrounds, and he added the meaning <b>לא ימיש</b>."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 55, :notes {1 "The referent of \"he added\" (הוסיף) is uncertain; possibly the Psalmist, possibly a commentator. The phrase לא ימיש appears to cite or allude to language from elsewhere; left untranslated as it is quoted Hebrew, though its connection to רחב requires the reader to infer it."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:50.474775414Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}